# needs-native-review: conversation notes, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "conversation notes: the heading"
msgid "Conversation notes"
msgstr "Notas de las conversaciones"

# needs-native-review: conversation notes, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "conversation notes: who reads them"
msgid "Private to the people who hold each conversation, the role that makes the final call, and the people who place roles. Never shown to the applicant. No AI reads them."
msgstr "Privadas para quienes tienen cada conversación, el rol que toma la decisión final y quienes asignan los roles. Nunca se muestran a la persona que postula. Ninguna IA las lee."

