# needs-native-review: the bell, conversation notes, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "the bell: why a notice of this kind matters, kind application_conversation_notes"
msgid "An interviewer added notes to a conversation with an applicant. Read them on the application. The applicant never sees them."
msgstr "Una persona entrevistadora agregó notas a una conversación con alguien que postula. Léalas en la postulación. Quien postula nunca las ve."

# needs-native-review: the bell, conversation notes, 27 Nov 2026
msgctxt "the bell: several notices of one kind batched into a line, kind application_conversation_notes"
msgid "{n} conversations have new notes."
msgstr "{n} conversaciones tienen notas nuevas."
